  <book code="2TH" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:13 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka Thưq vaarq</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Th</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Phao-lô, ji Sin-vanh, kung dii Ti-mô-thê, atăq ka Tayuup Vah Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka đom Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing aduq Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, ji Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn tol oh ay.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Wơơy oh ay, 'wot pheq hloay kuh kway Kơy Plêêk truh oh ay, đaji nưq laa Varơuq jơq troq, vii xuum tuôq oh ay hngơy kang kôt tok, ji xuum xung xiaq ku tôôy muuyq dro đom dêq hloay oh ay đôôyq dii mamuuyq kưq athêêp tok; <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />pheq đnooy 'wot pa ưưt xăk aduq oh ay đom katul kaluh tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk truh varơuq kajưk xuum ku oh ay ji xuum tuôq katul tôôy đơơt rôp toop ku oh ay, kung dii kaluh pơơl dal đơu oh ay đong pheq chiuq, <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />nưq laa bơơn xanưk truh varơuq xưh xadrah hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk deng ka oh ay xôq jah 'yo laa taxưngq dii daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, vii daak dêh nưq đơu oh ay kung đong chiuq pơơl; <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Vii dik laa hyioh jăk tuôôy Kơy Plêêk dook bla varơuq pơơl dal tol khơl adro dơơp pơơl dal ka oh ay, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />ji kahniq ka oh ay, laa khơl adro chiuq pơơl dal, varơuq padơy pado kung 'wot tuôôy varơuq rama truh ku Lôôk Jê-xu kahnoq vlôh xing plêêk dii khơl kơy yaak kalh paraat ku Kadraq, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />đom xaar ôôlh rahưk, xagook varơuq hmơt dook truh ka khơl adro leh 'yo xet Kơy Plêêk ji ka khơl adro leh tameng tyauq Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />nưq laa khơl adro hnoq pơq xok varơuq hmơt dook — laa varơuq păk kaxêêt dêq đơơy đơơy, xangưưy mot Lôôk ji klơlh tađnah tađnaak ku taay yaak Kadraq, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />tuôôy Kadraq truh xôq jah vanê ayuôôt bơyh khơl vah ku Kadraq ji jah 'yo atrêêk katul tôôy adro heq xôq xuum tuôq, vii apok xanưk ku 'wot truh dii oh ay đom hngơy nưq heq jah tuôq nhonq. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Vii kơq nưq, 'wot măn hloay apôôy ka oh ay xôq Kơy Plêêk haay 'yo oh ay laa taxưngq dii varơuq tawooyh taayh, ji xôq kadraq dơơp jêêk tôôy xuum trôôch truh varơuq kaxay ji varơuq dơơp ku xuum tuôq xing taay yaak, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />xôq ka yal ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, jah vanê ayuôôt aduq oh ay ji oh ay jah tađnah tađnaak aduq Kadraq, tyauq vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Wơơy oh ay, măn ka varơuq truh ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji varơuq tưưuq tagumq ku haay dii Kadraq, 'wot xiin oh ay <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />đaneq oh ay te hlơu klêq biq xôôl dôôl long varaal vari đom xuum biit oh ay, kung te xing muuyq garu xi, long xing muuyq apok pato dayq, long xing muuyq hla thư dang đaji truh xing 'wot, tuôôy đnooy đaneq hngơy ku Lôôk heq truh yôôch. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Apôôy leh muuyq adro leq tyauq paq kê kach leq hnoq ik aluut pa ôôh oh ay, vii đêh vlôh varơuq chôôyq ka'lăk đaauq truh adroyq, ji koot manih ku varơuq leh ganuun jah kahnoq vlôh, nưq laa adro koot ku varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />laa adro tachơơl 'yarơ ji vanê kadih ni tok tachơơl hlê dii tôôy varơuq jah taayh laa yaak long laa adro xôq ayuôôt laat, pheq đnooy kadih ni 'ngôôy đom hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk, kahnoq vlôh đaneq jơq ni laa Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Oh ay leh văch đaneq, tuôôy đong măn dii oh ay, gô 'miêh heq ăm ka oh ay xet kaluh varơuq neq aleq? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ji juneq oh ay heq xet varơuq kajoq đong klơl hlê, xôq ni vơ ik e mot muut klip kawat ku ni. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Vii varơuq kadook ku varơuq leh ganuun đong dưk dơơp yôôch, Kơy vơ muuyq đong klơl jư ni jơu neq măn e dong truh tuôôy Kơy nưq vlôh klơlh aduq klơl jư katul, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ji yôôch adro leh ganuun hnoq jah kahnoq vlôh, laa adro đơu Lôôk Jê-xu hnoq păk kaxêêt bơơn hoot heet ku huuy Kadraq, Ji hnoq khienq ni jêêk vlôh hư hlơơp xing tađnah tađnaak varơuq rama truh ku Kadraq, <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />đơu varơuq rama vlôh ku adro leh ganuun hơq laa gamưh muut varơuq dơơp ku Sa-tan bơơn dêq hloay da uh kung hlêêl akêh, kung đaji pheep akêh pa ôôh, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />ji dii tôôy kiêuh pa ôôh leh hyioh deng ka khơl adro hư hlơơp, đơu oot hư hlơơp laa vii oot heq be nhonq xok xuum xung xiaq dong dik ka oot xôq jah wơơt. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ji vii kakơq nưq, Kơy Plêêk pahnăp oot đom ahluk ku varơuq hyaak hyul xôq oot tuôq varơuq pa ôôh, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />xôq ka dêq hloay oot hnoq biq xưh xadrah, nưq laa khơl adro leh tuôq varơuq dik, đơu laay hlah trôôch varơuq leh hyioh.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, laa khơl adro jah Lôôk xiaq, 'wot pheq hloay kuh kway Kơy Plêêk truh oh ay. Vii Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh oh ay đaji kaluh play adroyq dik xôq jah vanong wơơt xok gamưh varơuq vah xarêh ku Kơy Phool Hiel ji xuum tuôq aduq varơuq dik. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Vii xôq jah vanong nưq, Kadraq heq tawooyh taayh oh ay gamưh Hêêl Kaxay ku 'wot, truh dii varơuq jah nhonq tađnah tađnaak ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay, dayh dưk kajưk ji jư chăk kaluh pato dayq hnu đơu oh ay heq jah pato dayq, long atoh bơơn apok đnooy long bơơn hla thư ku 'wot.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Apôôy kadih Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, Kơy xung xiaq haay ji heq kahniq ăm ka haay varơuq hlơq hlôôp đơơy đơơy kung dii varơuq takôô gamưh kaxay tamaq xing vanong plêêk, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />xiin Kadraq ahmưk nhăk ji dơơp ka kajưk kalh xuum klaak oh ay đom tôôy varơuq dơơp kung apok đnooy tamaq kaxay.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Lôôch dik, wơơy oh ay, xiin apôôy ka 'wot, xôq apok ku Lôôk dayh pahêêr vlôh ji jah ayuôôt laat, kung đaji heq jah hloq aduq oh ay, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />ji xôq 'wot jah wơơt klơlh khơl adro xơk va ih ji xơk tauq, vii leh aalq tôôy adro raay e xuum tuôq. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Bơh Lôôk, Kơy hnoq dơơp ka kajưk kalh ji jư 'yo oh ay klơlh adro xơk, Kadraq laa Jư apok. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />'Wot tuôq kajưk aduq Lôôk truh oh ay đaneq oh ay đong dơơp ji hnoq dơơp kaluh varơuq 'wot pato dayq. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Apôôy vôôch Lôôk pato jarooy xuum oh ay wih truh xuum xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk ji truh dii varơuq atuq xuum ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Lunư, wơơy oh ay, taayh yal Lôôk haay laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'wot đnooy dăt oh ay, xôq oh ay chuh xangưưy tôôy adro tuôq riirh bơyq ba ji leh tyauq kaluh varơuq pato hnu đơu oh ay heq nhonq xing 'wot. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Vii kadih oh ay xet duh pheq dơơp atôôlh 'wot đaleq, vii 'wot heq lưp riirh leh bơyq ba đom katul oh ay, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />'wot kung leh xa hloh tuôông xa xing muuyq adro leq, bơh klôôy hngơy dơơp varơuq đom đơơt pơơl hwơơl ji galeh galal xôq leh dơơp gengq parêq ka dêq hloay kơyq đom oh ay, <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />be aalq vii 'wot leh e qwuyen, đơu xôq 'wot hnoq ik kadih xôq xăk đaji tômq ramil ka oh ay xôq atôôlh 'wot. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Vii pheq đnooy tuôôy 'wot đong măn dii oh ay, 'wot 'miêh heq đnooy dăt oh ay varơuq neq, đaneq: “Atoh adro leq leh trôôch dơơp varơuq yôôych adro nưq kung te xa.” <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Vii 'wot tameng đnooy đom katul oh ay e muuyq sôôq manih riirh bơyq ba, leh dơơp varơuq đơu long tabông muut varơuq be aalq ku oot. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Bơh đom Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'wot đnooy dăt ji ahmưk nhăk khơl adro đanưq, xôq ka oot hnoq ik xok tuôông xa ku oot tuôôy dơơp varơuq kung dii varơuq hnhep. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Măn oh ay, oh ay te galeh galal tuôôy dơơp varơuq troq. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Panưh kadrơy, atoh adro leq leh tameng jư apok 'wot gamưh thư neq, yôôych dayh văch 'yo adro nưq — xôq leh xa athêêk dii ni, xôq ka adro nưq hloq kamưưl kadih. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Te 'yo adro nưq đaji adro tachơơl, đơu dayh ahmưk nhăk đaji muuyq adro oh ay.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Apôôy vôôch kadih Lôôk hrok hrol kahniq ăm oh ay varơuq hrok hrolh gamưh tôôy varơuq đom tôôy panưh. Apôôy Lôôk măn kung dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Apok vôôch hlơq neq xing kadih ti gô — Phao-lô — nưq laa chư kiq đom tôôy hla thư. Gô ragơy valơk đanưq. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn dii dêq hloay oh ay.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>